{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072110/extras/8952c0b3f6a5c19977fb5a8fd0f7c79c.avif?t=1769256004\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THIS GAME IS DESIGNED TO BE ENJOYED FOR ABOUT 1 - 1.5 HOURS</strong>    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >---------------------------------</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase Fox's seventh game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Truth Universally Acknowledged - Seasilk Heart is a short mermaid dating sim.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talay starts a new life under the sea, and has found love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Genre</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slice of life, Romantic Comedy, Mermaid Core, Magical Realism, Dating Sim, Visual Novel </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Art, Music &amp; Sound Design</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Love Interests</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072110/extras/426b141ed959b05bbfc78d8675562d8c.avif?t=1769256004\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>Vincent</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gardener who has an interest in botany and gemology.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072110/extras/331af4fafcc1a7f63e83f11a7e0302a5.avif?t=1769256004\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>Mel</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A renowned dressmaker of the underwater world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swim Around</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you can swim around a small space, interact with things and talk to characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072110/extras/ca60495d01bd949e03672542edc4e97e.avif?t=1769256004\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reaction System</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you talk to characters you can react to the conversation you are having. By choosing the correct reactions you will gain affinity points and choosing the wrong reactions you will lost affinity points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0You can learn what each character like and don't like by studying the information given by the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Flower System</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every new day in the game brings with it new flowers on the map. Each characters like different flowers. Pick the flowers and give it to them when they ask for it to increase your affinity points with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After having high enough affinity levels with characters, you can unlock their story to read. There are three character routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072110/extras/2bdd1458c5acfc499764c0617b5d8fba.avif?t=1769256004\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------- </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story, Art, Music and Sound Design </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by ChaseFOX </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proofread</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by Eskay </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4072110?t=1769256004","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4072110?t=1769256004","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072110/cb500f978d8293565810a8ed347d29c51a846391/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769256004","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072110/cb500f978d8293565810a8ed347d29c51a846391/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769256004","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072110/extras/8952c0b3f6a5c19977fb5a8fd0f7c79c.avif?t=1769256004\" width=800 heig